A file argument bypasses the walk entirely: the mask below matches nothing anywhere in the tree, yet
the run still yields exactly one entry, whose `path` is the argument verbatim rather than a path
relative to a root.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping session-stats vault/plan/index.md --mask nothing-matches.md --dry-run
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
{
  "artifacts": [
